Some race/role combinations are much easier than others.
The easiest one is the "Female doppelganger wizard" - with a starting
ring of polymorph control.  Try one.  When you reach Exp. level 2, you
will have the ability to polymorph at will into the monster of your
choice (you will have the 10 Pw required to #youpoly).
Self-polymorph will give you tremendous options - here are a few
examples:
1) basilisk - lay a big pile of eggs, put all but 1 in a bag for
stoning grenades and a really effective pet - need a good supply of
food first.
2) Crystal golem - 300HP and all useful resistances/intrinsics, plus a
random breath attack - very useful after you have the Eye (for Pw.
regen)
3) Giant shoggoth - useful for an overpowered attack against stoning
resistant monsters - i.e. One Eye'd Sam
4) Xorn - useful for eating rings/amulets, fast exploring of levels,
safely fleeing into solid rock.

Remember to get Magicbane as quickly as possible.  Techniques can be a
lifesaver - use liquid leap to escape.  Avoid getting unpolymorphed
through HP loss - that can also halve your unpolymorphed MAXHP -
instead #youpoly back into human form manually.



